invalid type: string "### Q2: What is the vendor onboarding process?\nVendors submit GSTIN, PAN, and Bank details. Accounts Payable verifies credentials and registers vendor master in FINPIXE ERP.\n\n### Q3: What is Tax Deducted at Source (TDS)?\nTDS is tax withheld on specified payments like professional services (194J) or rent (194I) before remitting payment to vendors.", expected a booleanÿÿÿÿÿ